   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "barinov",
   "t": "Нам надо поймать их всех.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'We need to catch them all.' Let us consider the phrase: ",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "barinov",
   "t": "поймать",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": " means to catch successfully, and it has the sense that you've got it. ",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "barinov",
   "t": "их",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "barinov",
   "t": "всех",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": ", them all, is the form for the people or things being caught.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
