  },
  {
   "v": "barinov",
   "t": "Не стойте просто так, ищите!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Do not just stand like that, search!' We will examine this line: ",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
