   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": " is a stock phrase for 'for no reason'. The negative order and the positive one sit side by side, which is typical of an angry boss.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "max",
   "t": "Я сейчас его поймаю.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
